    "chunk_text": "3 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a \u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 ! \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf #\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf%&\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf( \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9+ \u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3- \u0db4/\u0dba \u2013 2019.09.02 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 02.09.2019\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS\n\n(Covering up duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 20th August, 2019 09 - 535/5\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 (Section 12) NOTICE No : 51/1100 Gampaha District It is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the owner-ship or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 510804 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Akaravita (Block 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 222B -Akaravita in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Gampaha in the District of Gampaha in the Province of Western should submit his claim to the undersigned before 25th Septem-ber, 2019 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an exparte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such\n\ndetermination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 510804 referred to above may be pe-rused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secre-tariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement. P.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement (Covering up duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 20th August, 2019 09 - 535/6"
