    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2139$38 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 04 jeks nodod - 2019'09'04No. 2139/38 - WEDNESDAY SEPTEMBER 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE GODAKAWELAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member in Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of ceased to bemember of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United Progressive Alliance (Democratic People\u2019s Front at Present), therecognized political party to which Rajamanikkam Asok Kumar the member belonged, was required by me under Section66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of United Progressive Alliance (DemocraticPeople\u2019s Front at Present) who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Annamalai Bothimathavan to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Suranga Ambagahathenne, Returning Officer of the Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatAnnamalai Bothimathavan was selected as the member of the Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nSURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Godakawela Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,02nd September, 2019.\n\n09 - 586\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\