    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'04PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 04.09.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2139$47 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 04 jeks nodod - 2019'09'04No. 2139/47 - WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nAppointments & C., by the Governors\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nUVA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAPPOINTMENTS MADE BY THE HON. GOVERNOR OF UVA PROVINCE\n\nIT is hereby announce that, the following Appointments have been made by Hon. President's Counsel Marshall Perera, theGovernor of the Uva Province under the Section 32 (1) of the Provincil Council Act, No. 42 of 1987 of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\n1.District Sports officer Mr. R. M. S. L. B. Rathnayake, to cover up duties of the Director of Sports of UvaProvince, with effect from the date 13.05.2019.\n\n2.Mrs. A. A. L. Amarasekara, Class III officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to perform the duties ofthe Commissioner of Badulla Municipal Council, with immediate effect (from the date 15.05.2019) on full timebasis.\n\n3.Dr. Mrs. J. C. M. Thennakoon, as Provincial Director of Health Service of Uva Province, with effect fromthe date 06.06.2019.\n\n4.Mrs R. A. H. A. Samarasinghe, Retired special Grade officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, has beenre- appointed on contract basis as the Secretary to the Council of the Uva Provincial Council, from the date23.07.2019 up to 30.11.2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4639\u2014 67 (09/2019)\n\nMy Number :- 01/10/03/04\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'04PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 04.09.20192A"
