    "chunk_text": "My Number :- 01/10/03/04\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'04PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 04.09.20192A\n\n5.Mr. Dayananda Rathnayake, Class I officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to act as the Secretary tothe Ministry of Sports, Youth Affairs, Tourism, Transport, Cultural Affairs, Textiles and Small Industries of theUva Provincial Council, with effect from the date 22.07.2019 on full time basis.\n\n6.Rural Development officer Mr. H. M. Wasantha Kithsiri Bandara, to Perform the duties of the Director ofRural Development of Uva Province, in addition to the duties of his permanent post, with immediate effect(from the date 23.07.2019).\n\n7.Engineer S. N. B. M. Pathmasiri, the Provincial Mechanical Director of Uva Province, has been hospitalizedfor medical treatment on 10.07.2019, until he reports duty, Engineer M. T. G. A. N. Lakmal Class III officer of theSri Lanka Engineering Service, has been appointed to cover up the duties of the Provincial MechanicalDirector of Uva Province, in addition to the duties of his permanent post from the date 10.07.2019.\n\n8.Engineer A. A. P. S. K. Karunarathna, Special Grade officer of the Sri Lanka Engineering Service, as theDeputy Chief Secretary (Engineering Services) of Uva Province, with effect from the date 12.10.2018.\n\n9.Mrs. R. H. C. Priyanthi, Class III officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to perform the duties ofProvincial Commissioner of Land of Uva Province, with immediate effect (from the date 24.07.2019) on full timebasis.\n\n10.Mr. M. M. Wijenayake, Class I officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to act as the Senior AssistantSecretary to the Ministry of Education of Uva Province, in addition to the duties of his permanent post, withimmediate effect (from the date 24.07.2019).\n\nR. M. T. B. HATHIYALDENIYA,Secretary to the Governor of Uva Province.\n\nOffice of the Uva Governor,30th August, 2019."
