    "chunk_text": "wxl 2139$50 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 04 jeks nodod - 2019'09'04\n\nNo. 2139/50 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 04, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30899 - 17 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: GCF/ATH/KD/23/LR.\n\nLand Min's Ref. No. : 13/97/LRB/360.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the land described below to develop water retainingarea in upper part of the Parliament Lake under GreaterColombo Flood Control and Environment Promotion Project.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nTwo (02) allotments of land in total extent of about 0.1892Hectare depicted as Lot No. 01 and 02 in the Plan No. Co. 9790\n\ndated 31.01.2019 prepared by the Survey General situated inthe village called Pelawaththa in the Grama Niladhari DivisionNo. 479 F of Aruppitiya within Kaduwela Municipal Councilminor division in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofKaduwela in Colombo District of Western Province anddescribed as follows.\n\n01. Lot No. 01Name of the land: Could not be traced; Present land use:Home garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: W. K. G. N.Perera, No. 47/50, Perera Mawatha, Thalangama South,Battaramulla; Extent: 0.1629 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02Name of the land: Could not be traced; Present land use:Home garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: WelikadageBadra Rohini Perera, No. 41/1, Pagoda Road, Nugegoda; Extent:0.0263 Hectare.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'04PART III - GAZETTE E