    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2139/53 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.04\n\nNo. 2139/53 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef. No.: THI/LND/L2/ACQVI/92-1 VOL\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7, of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land /servitude which is required for the public purpose mentioned below.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:- Following allotments of lands containing in total extent of 2.1899 hectares depicted as Lot Nos. from 1 to 37 in preliminary plan No. 2789 dated 17.07.2019 prepared by Senior Survey Superintendent of Matara District for Surveyor General, situated in the village of Nadugala in Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of Nadugala 2\u2014No. 337 in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thihagoda Matara District. Lot No.01 Name of the land: \u2014; Description: Road; Extent: 0.1945 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 02 Name of the land: Ihalawatta; Description: Home garden, Permanent building and mixed crop cultivation; Extent: 0.0278 Hectare. Lot No. 03 Name of the land: Ihalawatta and Henegewatta; Description: Home garden, mixed crop cultivation; Extent: 0.0286 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 04 Name of the land: Henegewatta; Description: \u2014; Extent: \u2014.\n\nLot No. 05 Name of the land: Henegewatta; Description: Home garden, mixed crop cultivation; Extent: 0.0762 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 06 Name of the land: Ihalawatta, Henegewatta and Addaragewatta; Description: Barren land; Extent: 0.0229 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 07 Name of the land: Henegewatta and Pussahena; Description: Home garden, Permanent building and mixed crop cultivation; Extent: 0.1399 Hectare.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30901 - 17 (2019/09)"
