    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'06PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.09.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nMy No.: MCUDP/LA/MUT(W-14)/14/02/A.Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: 4-3/10/2015/LRB/285.\n\nThe Public is hereby notified that the compensation payments inrespect of allotment of land of which the claims were not presentedas depicted in the Schedules 01 to 14 below and included inPreliminary Plan No. 9654 dated 07.10.2016 prepared by theSurveyor General which are to be acquired to the Government throughSection 7 Notice under the Land Acquisition Act( Chapter 460)published in the Gazette Notification No. 2095/ 38 dated 01.11.2016under Metro Colombo Urban Development Project, have beendeposited in the District Court, Colombo under case numbersdepicted in the same schedule under Section 33 of the Act.\n\nThe General Public is hereby informed that any claimant to theallotments mentioned below could obtain the compensation payablefor the allotment concerned after submitting necessary documents tothe District Court, Colombo to prove their ownership.\n\nC. W. Abeysuriya,Land Acquiring Officer.Rajagiriya.\n\nMetro Colombo Urban Development Project,Land Acquisition Office, No. 03,Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya.06th September 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2139$72 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 06 jeks isl=rdod \u2013 2019'09'06No. 2139/72 \u2013 FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 06, 2019\n\nSCHEDULE No. 1"
