    "chunk_text": "wxl 2139$73 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 06 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'09'06\n\nNo. 2139/73 \u2013 FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 06, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- PG 4641 - 107 (2019/09)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No.: 3/1/86/2016.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms\n\nReference No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/355.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 1.9311Hectares, Lots 44 - 89 (31 lots) Under mentioned land shownin the Surveyor General\u2019s Cadastral Map No. 420179 , BlockNo.01, Sheet No.02, dated 27.06.2019 situated in the village ofHathupitiya in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 530,Dodangahakotuwa in Rideegama Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision in Kurunegala District of North Western Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 44Name of the Land: Diganwelewatta; Description of Land:Estate; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: RathnayakeMudiyanselage Seelawathi Manike; Extent: 0.0425 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 45Name of the Land: Diganwelewatta; Description of Land:Canal; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: RathnayakeMudiyanselage Seelawathi Manike; Extent: 0.0001 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 46Name of the Land: Diganwelewatta; Description of Land:Canal; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: RathnayakeMudiyanselage Seelawathi Manike; Extent: 0.0002 Hectare.\n\n4. Lot No. 47Name of the Land: Hathupitiye Kumbura; Description ofLand: Canal; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant:Rathnayake Mudiyanselage Seelawathi Manike; Extent: 0.0013Hectare."
