    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'09PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.09.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nRef. No.: HAK/5/1/1/109(ii).\n\nI, Kusalaka Nanayakkara, Divisional Secretary of Hakmana do herebynotify under Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)that due compensation of Rupees One Hundred and Forty Thousand(Rs. 140,000.00) for acquisition of land which is fully described inthe following schedule is deposited in the District Court of Mataraagainst the Case No. M.L.A. 16927 for making payment to theclaimants.\n\nKusalaka Nanayakkara,Divisional Secretary,Hakmana .\n\n06th September, 2019.Hakmana Divisional Secretariat.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nLand called Aluthwatta in extent of 0.071 Hectare (28.07 P.)depicted as Lot No. 60 in the Final Village Plan No. F.V.P. 498 dated28.08.2007 which has been certified by Senior Superintendent ofSurveys of Matara District, situated in the Village of Lalpe in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Hakmana, Matara District,Southern Province.\n\n09 \u2013 784/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2140$5 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 09 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2019'09'09No. 2140/5 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 09, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nRef. No.: HAK/5/1/1/109(ii).\n\nI, Kusalaka Nanayakkara, Divisional Secretary of Hakmana do herebynotify under Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)that due compensation of Rupees One Thousand (Rs. 1,000.00) foracquisition of land which is fully described in the following scheduleis deposited in the District Court of Matara against the CaseNo. M.L.A. 16900 for making payment to the claimants.\n\nKusalaka Nanayakkara,Divisional Secretary,Hakmana ."
