    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 182, 185, 186, 187, 188, 198, 206, 220, 234, 239, 288, 302, 303, 305, 309, 313, 319, 329 and 334 of Block 03, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 320056, situ-ated in the Village of Orayanwatta within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 1154 - Orayanwatta in the Divisional Secretary's Divi-sion of Udapalatha, in the District of Kandy, in the Province of Central, referred to in Notice No. 030111 calling for claims to land par-cels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1206/05 of 16th October, 2001 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement (Covering up Duties.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 10th July, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 30933 - 14 (2019/09)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2140/07 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0014\u0dad\u0dd0\u0016\u0db6\u0018 09 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001a \u0dc3\u001b\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.09 No. 2140/07 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 09, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u