    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'10PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 10.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2140$17 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 10 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'10No. 2140/17 - TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nL.D.B 3/2012(III)\n\nTOURISM ACT, No. 38 OF 2005\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Tourism Development, Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs on the adviceof the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority under Section 69 of the Tourism Act, No. 38 of 2005 read with Subsections(3), (6) and (7) of Section 48 and Subsection (1) of Section 50 of the aforesaid Act.\n\nJOHN ANTHONY EMMANNUAL AMARATHUNGA,Minister of Tourism Development,Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs.Colombo,04th September, 2019.\n\nREGULATIONS\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as Tourist (Guiding Services) Regulations No. 01 of 2019.\n\n2. (1) No person shall carry on a service of a tourist guide lecturer unless such service is registered under therelevant category of tourist guide lecturer referred to in regulation 2(2) hereto with the Sri Lanka Tourism DevelopmentAuthority (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAuthority\u201d) and obtained a license for such service from the Authority.\n\n(2) All tourist guide lecturers shall be designated into four categories on the basis of the services they areauthorized to perform as follows :-\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30945\u2014 27 (09/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'10PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 10.09.20192A"
