    "chunk_text": "\u201cArea Tourist Guide Lecturer\u201d means a person who is duly registered as an Area Tourist Giude and isthereby authorized by the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority to practise as a tourist guideonly within the area/s specified in the liense and with a vehicle of a seating capacity of not more thanseven ;\n\n\u201cNational Tourist Guide Lecturer\u201d means a person who is duly registered as a national tourist guide and isthereby authorized by the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority to practise as a National TouristGuide in any part of Sri Lanka.\n\n\u201cSite Tourist Guide Lecturer\u201d means a person who is duly registered as a site tourist guide and is therebyauthorized by the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority to practise as a Site Tourist Guide onlywithin the site/s specifid in the license.\n\n\u201cTourist Guide Lecturer\u201d means any person who provides or pefroms the tourist guide services as a NationalTourist Giude Lecturer ; Chauffeur Tourist Guide Lecturer ; Area Tourist Guide Lecturer, or SiteTourist Guide Lecturere ; and\n\n\u201cTourist Guide Service\u201d means a service provided to tourists by escorting them and giving them, informationand narrations concerning all aspects of tourist interest in Sri Lanka.\n\nSCHEDULE I\n\nRegulations 6 & 8\n\nMinimum requirement to be registered for the service of a Tourist Guide Lecturer.\n\n1.The applicant shall be a citizen of Sri Lanka .2.The age of the applicant shall be not less than 21 years and not more than 60 years on the closing date of theapplication.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'10PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 10.09.20195A"
