    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 17, 22, 24, 36, 39, 47 and 50 of Block 02, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 410111, situated in the Village of Puttalam within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 617 B - Puttalam East in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Puttalam, in the District of Puttalam, in the Province of North West-ern, referred to in Notice No. 41/0200 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2094/21 of 23rd October, 2018 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement (Covering up Duties.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 15th May, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 30955 - 14 (2019/09)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2140 / 28 \u2013 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0013\u0dad\u0dd0\u0015\u0db6\u0017 10 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0019 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2019.09.10\n\nNo. 2140 / 28 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a \u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0