    "chunk_text": "26.No person shall donate or distribute anything for charity either by cash or by any other means within the camp areaexcept in a place reserved or provided for begging and solicitation for charity under regulation 7.\n\n28.No person shall unduly alter or remove any notice or name board displayed in any place under regulation 7 or 10.\n\n29.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/ Government Agent, Medical Officer, Public Health Inspector or anyPolice Officer to,\n\n(a) Enter any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of carrying out any regulation fromamong these regulations and,\n\n(b) To construct or erect a post in any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of displaying anotice or a name board under regulation 7.\n\n30.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/ Government Agent to cancel the following at any time if he considersthat the cancellation is appropriate or it is for the benefit in the public interest.\n\n(a)Any permission given under regulation 06 or regulation 27.(b)Permit issued under regulation 09.(c)Any license issued under regulation 15.\n\nSchedule\n\nThe margins of the land which belongs to Mihinthale Rajamaha Viharaya which is situated in Grama Niladaris\u2019s Division inNo. 577, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mihinthale, Anuradhapura District are, indicated as follows:\n\nNorth:A 12 Main Road\n\nSouth :Kaduwata Road\n\nEast:Kaduwata Road\n\nWest:A 9 Main Road\n\n09 - 835\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
  },
