    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Ms. Paranahewage Harriyet Margaret Fernando who resides in the village of Katukurunda, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Moratuwa, in the District of Colombo. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Ms. Paranahewage Harriyet Margaret Fernando described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 16th October, 2019 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Covering up duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 02nd September, 2019.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2140/38 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0015\u0dad\u0dd0\u0017\u0db6\u0019 10 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001b \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.10\n\nNo. 2140/38 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2019\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 30961 - 14 (2019/09)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba - 2019