    "chunk_text": "NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT NO. OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mr. Jienudeen Sadikeen who resides in the village of Gampola East, in the Divisional Secre-tary\u2019s Division Udapalatha, in the District of Kandy. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Jienudeen Sadikeen de-scribed in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 16th October, 2019 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998.\n\n6 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba - 2019.09.10 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 10.09.2019\n\nP.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Covering up duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 02nd September, 2019. SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Map No. of Title No. Registration Division (Hectare) Harispatthuwa Wegiriya 320460 Block 01 0.0363 00362532051 Kandy Parcel No. 154\n\nN.B.- Letters claiming a right to intestate property should mention the Cadastral Map number, parcel number and the entitlement of the claimant to claim such property. The top left-hand corner of the envelope should bear the phrase \u201cApplication for Intestate Property.\u201d\n\n09-819/8\n\n7 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2