    "chunk_text": "wxl 2140$44 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 11 jeks nodod - 2019'09'11\n\nNo. 2140/44 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 11, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30970 - 22 (09/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS\n\nAMENDED BY LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT\n\nNotice under Section 07\n\nMy Ref. No.: BKP/LAND/ACQUI/D2/1/3.Land Ministry's No. : 4-3/15/2016/VE/426.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 ofLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act of, No. 28 of 1964, that Government intendsto acquire the allotments of lands which have been enclosedin the land called Kiriporuwa Part II mentioned in the schedulefor acquisition of land for resettlement of displaced personsby landslides in 2016 in Divisional Secretary's Division ofBulathkohupitiya.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nAllotment of lands No. 6, 7 (Lots 02) mentioned in theSchedule and enclosed in the P.P.K. No. 3679 of Superintendentof Surveys, Kegalle situated in the Village of Kiriporuwa inGrama Niladhari Division of Kiriporuwa in DivisionalSecretary's Division of Bulathkohupitiya in Kegalle District inSabaragamuwa Province.\n\nLot No. 01, 02, 03, 04, 05, 06Name of Land: Kiriporuwa Part II; Claimants Name andAddress: 01. Lands Reform Commission No. 475, KaduwelaRoad, Battaramulla. 02. Managing Director Kegalle PlantationsPLC No. 310, High-level Road, Maharagama. 03. Ministry ofPlantation Industries Second Floor, Sethsiripaya, Stage II,Battaramulla; Extent: 1.8729 Hectares.\n\nDate of examinations for claims of compensation:\n\nFor Lots No. 06, 07 in P.P.L. No. 3679 on 15th October, 2019at 10.00 a.m."
