    "chunk_text": "wxl 2140$51 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 12 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'12\n\nNo. 2140/51 \u2013 THERSDAY, SEPTEMBER 12, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30977 - 22 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.:4-3/6/2018/HW/18.\n\nMy Ref. No. : DSB/LND/02/F1/XV-13/2019.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nLot No. 958 - 970 (Lots -13) allotments of land in Total Extentof about 0.3032 Hectare, in Finel Village Plan No. 297,Supplement No. 20, Sheet No. 18 and dated 24.07.2019 preparedby the Sinior - Superintendent of Surveyor of HambantotaDistrict on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in thevillage of Mahaheella in the Grama Niladhari Division ofNo. 343, Mahaheella North in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Beliatta in Hambantota District in the SouthProvince.\n\n01. Lot No. 958Name of land: Dangahahena; Description: Scrub; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: H. K. Rathnayaka, Dangahahena,Weerasooriya Mawatha, Mahaheella, Beliatta (To finalisethe land acquisition, FVP 297 Lot (Parts) No. 199); Extent:0.0147 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 959Name of land: \u2013; Description: Scrub; Claimant: State; OriginalClaimant: - (FVP 297 Lot (Parts) No. 635); Extent: 0.0092 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 960Name of land: \u2013; Description: Road; Claimant: State; OriginalClaimant: \u2013 (FVP 297 Lot (Parts) No. 635); Extent: 0.0093Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 961Name of land: \u2013; Description: Road; Claimant: State; OriginalCl