    "chunk_text": "NOW THEREFORE, we, the Election Commission, in the exercise of the powers vested in the ElectionCommission by Section 64(2) of the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981 which shall be read with the provisions\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30913\u2014 387 (09/2019)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nof the Nineteenth Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do hereby notify thegeneral public that Mr. Manoj Prasanga Hewagampalage has been declared elected as a Member of the Eighth Parliamentfor the Electrol District No. 8 - Matara to fill the vacancy caused by reason of death of Mr. Gajadeera VidhanearachchigeBans Chandrasiri.\n\nMAHINDA DESHAPRIYAN. J. ABEYSEKERES. RATNAJEEVAN H. HOOLEChairmanMemberMemberElection CommissionElection CommissionElection Commission\n\nElections Secretariat,Rajagiriya,12th September, 2019."
