    "chunk_size_bytes": 1774,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2141/1- 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.16\n\nNo. 2141/1 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER, 16, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy No.: MN/DS/L/D1/AQ/WPP/02. Land Ministry No.: 4-3/2/2017/CEB/239. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired::\n\nThe Lands allotment called Olaittoduvaikani, Olaittoduvaiodai in total extent of about 3.3070 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1, 2 and 3 in Plan No. MN 830 and prepared by Surveyor General situated in the village called Olaittoduvai in the Grama Niladari Division No. 60 of Olaittoduvai, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mannar Town of Mannar District in Nothern Province.\n\nPlan No. MN 830 Lot No. 1, 2 and 3 Name of the land: Olaitthoduvaikani, Olaitthoduvaiodai; Present use of the land: Garden contain masonry well,\n\nchannel, Palmyra trees; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Kalutota Investment and Leasing Limited, 562/16, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya; Extent: 3.3070 Hectares.\n\nThe dates and the time of the inquiris: All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at 10.00 A. M. on the 10th day of October 2019 at Mannar Town Divisional Secretariat."
