    "chunk_text": "The dates and the time of the inquiris: All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at 10.00 A. M. on the 10th day of October 2019 at Mannar Town Divisional Secretariat.\n\nDivisional Secretariat of Mannar Town, 12th September, 2019.\n\n10-12\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30986 - 17 (2019/09)\n\nN. B.-s The Gazette Extraordinary Series No. 2140/1 ends with 2140/58\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.09.16 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.09.2019\n\n177/55 Mohedeen Majeed Road Mardhana & Abdul Cader Mohamed Fazeer of 13/1 Manthikadu, Nagavillu, Pallavi, Puttalam; Extent: 2.2000 Hectares.\n\nThe dates and the time of the inquires: All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at 10.00 a. m. on the 10th day of October 2019 at Mannar Town Divisional Secretariat.\n\nAnd further you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd day of October 2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for the compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\ngfg K. SIVASAMBU, Divisional Secretary, Mannar Town Division, Mannar.\n\nDivisional Secretariat of Mannar Town, 12th September, 2019.