    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'03'28PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.03.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the servitude described below in Paragraph1 is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act. The land over which the said servitude is tobe acquired is given in Paragraph 2.\n\n1. Description of the Servitude.\u2013 Servitude to be obtained underthe Asia Development Bank 5 project, acquiring a block of land forthe pipe line for waste water in the Bangadeniya water storage tank.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 Two (02) allotments of land calledKumbutukuliya depicted as Lots \u2018A\u2019 and \u2018B\u2019 in the Advance TracingNo. PU/ARC/2017/161 dated 31.05.2017, prepared by theSuperintendent of Surveys in charge of the Division of Puttlam andsituated in the Village of Kumbutukuliya in the Minor Division ofMunnessaram in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofArachchikattuwa, Puttlam District of North Western Province andcontaining to total extent of 0.0120 Hectare and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Kumbutukuliya Watta \u2013 Extent:0.0042 HectareNorth: Kumbutukuliya Watta claimed by M. M. G. HayasinthaCosta and Kumbutukuliya Road; East: Kumbutukuliya Watta\n\nclaimed by M. M. G. Hayasintha Costa and Lot B; South: Lot B andKumbutukuliya Watta claimed by Chandrasiri Mayakaduwa; West:Kumbutukuliya Watta claimed by Chandrasiri Mayakaduwa andKumbutukuliya Watta."
