    "chunk_text": "wxl 2141$24 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 18 jeks nodod - 2019'09'18\n\nNo. 2141/24 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 18, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) - GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31002 - 17 (2019/09)\n\nTOURISM ACT, No. 38 OF 2005\n\nI, John Amarathunga, Minister of Tourism Development, Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs, by virtue of power vestedin me by Section 70 of the Tourism Act, No. 38 of 2005 do hereby order in line with the Section 49(a) of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the land mentioned in the Schedule below is required to be acquired for the purpose of development of tourism bySri Lanka Tourism Development Authority.\n\nJOHN ANTONY EMMANUAL AMARATHUNGA,\n\nMinister of Tourism Development,Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs.\n\nColombo,18th September, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe land, Acres 29 Roods 03 Perch 20 in extent and depicted as lots A, B, C, D, E, F in the Advance Tracing No. Ya/TLL/2019/47 dated 02.09.2019 situated in Naguleshwaram Village in the Naguleshwaram (J/226) Grama Niladhari Division inDivisional Secretariat Division of Valikamam North, Thelipalai of Jaffna District in the Northern Province.\n\nThe boundaries of the land :\n\nNorth: Sea; East: Punnanputhukadu, Alvanmalayadi, Pathirayanputhukadu, Velarkadu and Solasinga-senathirajanputhukadu, Garden Claimant not known; South: Main Road (RDA); West: Valarkadu Alvanmalaiyadi or AlvanMalaiyadium Valarkadum Open waste land Claimed by Selvanayagam Senthilnathan and Saanthaluxmy Abimanyasingam.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
