    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'04PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 04.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2141$25 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 18 jeks nodod - 2019'09'18No. 2141/25 - WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 18, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nTHE PRESIDENTIAL ELECTIONS ACT, No. 15 OF 1981\n\nOrder under Section 2\n\nWHEREAS the term of office of the President expires on January eighth, 2020 :\n\nAnd whereas paragraph (3) of Article 31 of the Constitution requires that a poll for the Election of the President betaken not less than one month and not more than two months before the expiration of the term of office of the President inoffice :\n\nNow Therefore, we by virtue of the powers vested in the Election Commission by Section 2 of the PresidentialElections Act, No. 15 of 1981 read with Article 104 B of the Constitution fix, \u2013\n\nI.October 07, 2019 as the date of nomination of candidates for the Election of the President;\n\nII.Election Secretariat, Sarana Mawatha, Rajagiriya, as the place of nomination of candidates for such election;and\n\nIII.November 16, 2019, as the date on which the poll for such election shall be taken.\n\nMAHINDA DESHAPRIYA,N. J. ABEYSEKERE,S. RATHNAJEEVAN H. HOOLE,Chairman,Member,Member,Election Commission.Election Commission.Election Commission.\n\nElection Secretariat,Rajagiriya,On this 18th day of September, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30914\u2014 637 (09/2019)PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
