    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 76 of Block 05, con-tained in the Cadastral Map No. 320137, situated in the Village of Bothalapitiya within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 1109 - Bothalapitiya in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Udapalatha, in the District of Kandy, in the Province of Central, referred to in calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2129/30 of 25th June, 2019 in terms of Section 55 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 10th October, 2019\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31286 - 14 (2019/09)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2141/30 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0014\u0dad\u0dd0\u0016\u0db6\u0018 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001b \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.18\n\nNo. 2141/30 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 18, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \